  "body": "## What's Changed\n* docs: Create sprint planning document for 2026-03 by @t81dev in https://github.com/t81dev/t81-foundation/pull/502\n* build(deps): Bump anchore/sbom-action from 0.23.1 to 0.24.0 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/t81dev/t81-foundation/pull/492\n* build(deps): Bump docker/build-push-action from 6 to 7 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/t81dev/t81-foundation/pull/493\n* build(deps): Bump actions/cache from 5.0.3 to 5.0.4 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/t81dev/t81-foundation/pull/494\n* build(deps): Bump docker/setup-buildx-action from 3 to 4 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/t81dev/t81-foundation/pull/495\n* build(deps): Bump EndBug/add-and-commit from 9 to 10 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/t81dev/t81-foundation/pull/496\n* build(deps): Bump docker/metadata-action from 5 to 6 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/t81dev/t81-foundation/pull/497\n* build(deps): Bump docker/setup-qemu-action from 3 to 4 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/t81dev/t81-foundation/pull/498\n* build(deps): Bump actions/upload-artifact from 4 to 7 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/t81dev/t81-foundation/pull/499\n* build(deps): Bump github/codeql-action from 4.33.0 to 4.34.1 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/t81dev/t81-foundation/pull/500\n* build(deps): Bump docker/login-action from 3 to 4 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/t81dev/t81-foundation/pull/501\n* docs: add comprehensive T81 architecture report by @t81dev in https://github.com/t81dev/t81-foundation/pull/505\n* feat(demo): Add deterministic native AI governance demo by @t81dev in https://github.com/t81dev/t81-foundation/pull/506\n* Organize examples directory into a domain-driven hierarchy by @t81dev in https://github.com/t81dev/t81-foundation/pull/510\n* Fix CMake build errors due to missing example sources by @t81dev in https://github.com/t81dev/t81-foundation/pull/511\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/t81dev/t81-foundation/compare/v1.9.3...v1.9.4",
